**Title: These Free AI Tools Made College Life So Much Easier**

---

### 1. Hook (First 10 Seconds)

If you’re a college student feeling stressed about assignments, notes, or presentations, this video is for you. I’m not an AI expert or anything, but these free AI tools genuinely made my college life a lot easier, and I want to share what actually helped me.

